{"acronym": "DEF-TG", "archived": null, "badges": [], "contact_point": null, "created_at": "2024-12-17T20:30:41.306000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les donn\u00e9es ouvertes sur les \u00e9tablissements financiers au Togo fournissent des informations sur les institutions op\u00e9rant dans le secteur financier. Cela inclut les banques, microfinances, agences de transfert d'argent, assurances et autres structures li\u00e9es aux services financiers. Ces donn\u00e9es d\u00e9taillent la localisation g\u00e9ographique, les types de services propos\u00e9s et la couverture des infrastructures financi\u00e8res \u00e0 travers le pays. Elles permettent de comprendre l'accessibilit\u00e9 des services financiers pour les populations, de suivre le d\u00e9veloppement du secteur financier et de soutenir la prise de d\u00e9cision pour am\u00e9liorer l'inclusion financi\u00e8re au Togo.", "extras": {}, "frequency": "irregular", "frequency_date": "2024-12-17T01:00:00+00:00", "harvest": null, "id": "6761df717156b2067b148b07", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-12-17T20:30:41.306000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-01-08T17:50:45.320000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-01-08T17:50:45.320000+00:00", "last_update": "2025-01-08T17:50:45.316000+00:00", "license": "other-open", "metrics": {"discussions": 0, "followers": 0, "resources_downloads": 102, "reuses": 0, "views": 93}, "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "6760808d695e9dfc6b747e9a", "logo": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/32/634a9cf13b420794053416d7886ecb-original.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/32/634a9cf13b420794053416d7886ecb-100.png", "name": "Minist\u00e8re de l'\u00c9conomie et des Finances", "page": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/fr/organizations/ministere-de-leconomie-et-des-finances/", "slug": "ministere-de-leconomie-et-des-finances", "uri": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/api/1/organizations/ministere-de-leconom